  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bilans fourragers regionaux pour la resilience en zone pastorale</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve the information available to governments and partners for the development of emergency assistance programs, including early warning systems, and development programs in the livestock sector, in particular for the development of forage and feed systems.
Specific objectives: (i) the development of a methodology for estimating feed and forage balances in pastoral areas and (ii) the generation of improved information and knowledge about feed and forages balances, including spatial information, in Chad and Niger.</narrative>
  </description>
